  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "The playground is at the end of the street. Tom, Ben, and Lily get there. Pip runs behind them. \"Let's play Who Am I?\" says Ben. \"Close your eyes, Lily,\" says Tom. Lily closes her eyes. Ben says, \"I have blue jeans.\" \"I have a white shirt.\" \"I am next to the tree.\"",
      "Lily opens her eyes. She sees Tom and Ben. Both boys have blue jeans. Both boys have white shirts. \"Are you Tom?\" asks Lily. \"No,\" says Ben. \"Look at my shoes.\" \"They are green.\" Ben is next to the tree. \"You are Ben!\" says Lily.",
      "Now it is Lily's turn. Tom and Ben close their eyes. \"I have a pink shirt,\" says Lily. \"I have black shoes.\" \"I am behind the tree.\" \"Woof!\" says Pip. Tom looks behind the tree. \"It is Lily!\" says Tom. \"Is Pip in the game, too?\" asks Lily. Pip jumps and runs. It is a nice playground."
    ],
    "summary": "Tom, Ben, and Lily play a guessing game at the playground. They say what they wear and where they are, and Lily guesses who is who.",
